# RS-MobStand

> Automated mob farming for modern Minecraft servers.

Part of the RS Ecosystem by RSScripting.

---

## Overview

RS-MobStand allows players to generate mob drops through configurable Mob Stands without the need for traditional mob grinders.

Built with performance, scalability, and automation in mind, RS-MobStand serves as the resource generation layer of the RS Ecosystem.

---

## Ecosystem Flow

RS-MobStand
     ↓
RS-ItemMagnet
     ↓
RS-Auger
     ↓
RS-Warehouse

Generate → Collect → Transport → Store

---

## Features

✔ Automated mob drop generation

✔ Adult and baby mob filters

✔ Radius controls

✔ Leave Alive options

✔ Dynamic GUI menus

✔ SQLite persistence

✔ Chunk-safe operation

✔ Performance-focused design

✔ RS ecosystem integration

